# Keeping build output and local settings out of the build context makes the
# image smaller and stops a stale local build leaking into it.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/README.md
**/NuGet.config
